(text "24 V arrives from the panel XT90 and 7 A breaker on J1. The plug-in power module (PM1) carries the TPS2663 eFuse and the TPS7A4901." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ed0a8a93-6715-46f8-9a01-cd6e602352de))
(text "PM1 returns protected +24V, and makes +5VA (analog 5 V) from +12V. Its eFuse fault and current-monitor outputs go to the expander and ADC #2." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2cc55a8a-f974-493f-a6c4-2649981242ed))
(text "Pololu D24V22Fx pinout confirmed from the board: PG, EN, VIN, GND, VOUT (1-5) plus a corner GND (6). EN and PG unused." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3b43ac03-ffe2-4c99-b31d-b6e3421ff23e))
(text "LM1117: tantalum (or ESR-specified) 10 uF on input and output, per the TI datasheet." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid daaf9d79-ae8d-426d-81ef-7b663279ef10))
(text "+24V_FIELD feeds limit switches, the orifice selector and the E-stop status contact, through a 0.1 A PTC." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6a6f2a50-eedb-40f8-ac38-593c93c7bccd))
(text "Test points: 24 V area (supply, stepper and coil feeds) kept apart from the logic-supply area." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c8878b79-0c3d-493e-9cdd-998bf0582438))
